<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM POSTS 178 MLN GUILDER Q3 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>DSM POSTS 178 MLN GUILDER Q3 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit					 178  vs  234</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	   5.82  vs  6.44</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   2.48 vs  2.26</p>
<p>    Operating profit				 239  vs  342</p>
<p>    Financial charges				 14  vs  10</p>
<p>    Tax						   62  vs  114</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast DSM NV's third-quarter net</p>
<p>profit before extraordinaries at 181-212 million guilders, with</p>
<p>consensus at 196.7 million guilders.</p>
</text>
